  43:./inc/core_cm7.h **** 
  44:./inc/core_cm7.h ****    \li Required Rule 8.5, object/function definition in header file.<br>
  45:./inc/core_cm7.h ****      Function definitions in header files are used to allow 'inlining'.
  46:./inc/core_cm7.h **** 
  47:./inc/core_cm7.h ****    \li Required Rule 18.4, declaration of union type or object of union type: '{...}'.<br>
  48:./inc/core_cm7.h ****      Unions are used for effective representation of core registers.
  49:./inc/core_cm7.h **** 
  50:./inc/core_cm7.h ****    \li Advisory Rule 19.7, Function-like macro defined.<br>
