2100:./inc/core_cm7.h ****            priority bits (__NVIC_PRIO_BITS) the smallest possible priority group is set.
2101:./inc/core_cm7.h ****   \param [in]         Priority   Priority value, which can be retrieved with the function \ref NVIC
2102:./inc/core_cm7.h ****   \param [in]     PriorityGroup  Used priority group.
